          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "échangeur is built on échanger 'to exchange' with the ending -eur. Échanger comes from Old French eschangier, which is inherited from Vulgar Latin excambiāre (EtymDB): the place where cars exchange one road for another."
            }
          ]
        },
