              "text": "la bretelle — \"the slip road; the strap\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Le camion a pris la bretelle pour quitter l'autoroute. The lorry took the slip road to leave the motorway."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Les bretelles are also braces that hold up trousers."
            }
          ]
        },
